sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer as Telemetry Producer<br/>(llm-d gateway)
    participant TrainSvc as Training Server<br/>training-service:8000<br/>HTTP (no TLS)
    participant ModelStore as Model Store<br/>(in-memory + disk)
    participant Syncer as ModelSyncer Thread<br/>(prediction server)
    participant LocalDisk as Local Model Cache<br/>/local_models/
    participant PredSvc as Prediction Server<br/>prediction-service:8001<br/>HTTP (no TLS)
    participant Consumer as Inference Consumer<br/>(llm-d routing)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes<br/>kubelet

    Note over Producer,Consumer: Flow 1: Telemetry Ingestion & Model Training

    Producer->>TrainSvc: POST /add_training_data_bulk<br/>JSON payload (bulk samples)
    TrainSvc->>TrainSvc: Accumulate samples in memory
    TrainSvc->>ModelStore: Background retrain<br/>(XGBoost / LightGBM / BayesRidge)
    ModelStore-->>TrainSvc: Updated model artifacts<br/>(TTFT + TPOT, ensemble gated)

    Note over Syncer,LocalDisk: Flow 2: Model Synchronization (every 10s default)

    loop Every MODEL_SYNC_INTERVAL_SEC (default 10s)
        Syncer->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/info<br/>HTTP (no auth)
        TrainSvc-->>Syncer: Model metadata + timestamp
        alt Model is newer than local copy
            Syncer->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/download<br/>HTTP streaming (retry on 502/503/504)
            TrainSvc-->>Syncer: Model file bytes
            Syncer->>LocalDisk: Write model file<br/>(atomic rename)
            Syncer->>PredSvc: Reload models from disk
        end
    end

    Note over Consumer,PredSvc: Flow 3: Prediction Serving

    Consumer->>PredSvc: POST /predict<br/>JSON {features}
    PredSvc->>LocalDisk: Load current model
    LocalDisk-->>PredSvc: Model artifacts
    PredSvc-->>Consumer: JSON {ttft, tpot predictions}

    Consumer->>PredSvc: POST /predict/bulk<br/>JSON {batch features}
    PredSvc-->>Consumer: JSON {batch predictions}

    Consumer->>PredSvc: POST /predict/bulk/strict<br/>JSON {batch features}
    PredSvc-->>Consumer: JSON {strict batch predictions}

    Note over K8s,PredSvc: Flow 4: Health Probes

    K8s->>TrainSvc: GET /healthz (liveness)
    TrainSvc-->>K8s: 200 OK
    K8s->>TrainSvc: GET /readyz (readiness)
    TrainSvc-->>K8s: 200 OK

    K8s->>PredSvc: GET /healthz (liveness)
    PredSvc-->>K8s: 200 OK
    K8s->>PredSvc: GET /readyz (readiness)
    PredSvc-->>K8s: 200 OK
